      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 688,
        "content": "## Merge\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow is manually triggered, creates an initial field value, and evaluates it with an If node. Depending on the condition result, it sets different fields on one of two branches, then recombines the selected branch with a Merge node. The final No Operation node acts as a pass-through endpoint for inspecting the merged output.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- No external credentials are required for this workflow.\n- Configure the initial value in the first Edit Fields node.\n- Review the condition in the If node so it routes items as intended.\n- Adjust the two branch Edit Fields nodes and the Merge node mode to match the desired output structure.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the set fields on either branch, update the If condition, or switch the Merge mode if you want to combine data differently."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
